    "reasoning_and_limitations": "3.6L V6 and unleaded fuel established. Naturally aspirated is a derived conclusion from documented engine architecture and comparison with explicitly turbocharged engines; not an explicit MY2021 induction declaration. Conventional ESS versus ERG eTorque distinction and generic alternator/auxiliary battery evidence support none, but ESS alone or absence of eTorque does not prove it. Late automatic ERC requires its own revision applicability, not generic all-V6-automatic-eTorque assumptions.",
